// ============================================================================
// ModelSwapper -- donor MODELDEF blocks.
//
// Every donor lives under models/hud/, one folder per weapon. Where two
// donors share a mesh they differ only by Skin -- an alternate paint job
// costs a texture and no geometry.
//
// Anchored on STOCK DOOM sprites. The anchor only has to make
// FindModelFrame resolve so we inherit Path/Skin/Scale/Offset --
// psp.ModelFrame picks the frame that actually draws.
//
// DO NOT subclass a donor: FindModelFrameRaw compares smff->type == ti.
// ============================================================================

